WEBVTT

00:45.254 --> 00:48.966
PERFECT CROWN

00:59.851 --> 01:01.060
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

01:01.061 --> 01:03.062
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

01:03.063 --> 01:04.730
PROMISING THE END, NOT FOREVER…

01:04.731 --> 01:06.732
THE ROYAL COUPLE'S
MARRIAGE CONTRACT LEAKED

01:08.026 --> 01:10.278
Is it true that
the marriage is contractual?

01:10.279 --> 01:13.406
Is it true you plan to
divorce in three years? Please respond!

01:13.407 --> 01:15.741
ROYAL ACADEMY
80TH ANNIVERSARY CELEBRATION

01:15.742 --> 01:17.577
Did you intentionally
deceive the people?

01:17.578 --> 01:19.454
This is a betrayal of the public!

01:24.626 --> 01:26.795
What has Castle Group
promised the Crown?

01:44.980 --> 01:47.774
-  Is it true?
-  Are the allegations true?

01:49.318 --> 01:50.444
What are you doing?

01:52.821 --> 01:53.822
Keep your eyes on me.

02:25.020 --> 02:28.940
PERFECT CROWN

02:29.483 --> 02:31.026
EPISODE 9

02:37.699 --> 02:39.076
Let's get you out first.

02:39.576 --> 02:40.577
Your Royal Highness.

02:41.453 --> 02:44.747
It's swarming with reporters
and students outside.

02:44.748 --> 02:46.457
What should we do?

02:46.458 --> 02:48.752
- And the Royal Guard?
- We had dispatched the bare minimum.

02:55.842 --> 02:56.967
I'll leave first.

02:56.968 --> 02:58.678
- You two can--
- Your Royal Highness!

02:58.679 --> 02:59.846
I don't want to.

03:04.101 --> 03:05.226
Let's leave together.

03:26.415 --> 03:28.040
There they are!

03:28.041 --> 03:29.835
Any words
for the people watching?

03:30.335 --> 03:31.628
Is it all true?

03:34.714 --> 03:36.549
Are the allegations true?

03:36.550 --> 03:38.217
What comes after divorce?

03:38.218 --> 03:40.636
- Are you confirming the allegations?
- Your Royal Highness!

03:40.637 --> 03:41.888
- Are you okay?
- Yes.

03:42.889 --> 03:45.641
- Your Royal Highness, what say you?
- Are the allegations true?

03:45.642 --> 03:48.477
- Your Royal Highness!
- Please give us a response!

03:48.478 --> 03:49.895
Are the allegations true?

03:49.896 --> 03:52.064
Is it true that
this is a marriage of convenience?

03:55.485 --> 03:57.820
- Oh, no…
- They're tinted windows, Hyejeong.

03:57.821 --> 03:59.947
Really? Thank goodness.

04:08.081 --> 04:09.249
Right.

04:14.713 --> 04:16.465
Why isn't this working?
:cue

04:19.843 --> 04:21.552
They should be okay, right?

04:21.553 --> 04:24.222
I think so.
They have Prime Minister Min, so…

04:27.642 --> 04:31.145
Right. I should update
the Royal Guard.

04:31.146 --> 04:34.940
Right. I should also update
the Royal Secretariat.

04:34.941 --> 04:37.360
Is there any truth
to the allegations?

04:39.029 --> 04:40.947
Any response
to the allegations?

04:46.369 --> 04:47.454
We must hurry!

04:53.376 --> 04:54.586
Your Majesty.

04:56.505 --> 04:58.632
Where are the Grand Prince and Princess?

04:59.800 --> 05:01.468
You see, they are…

05:13.688 --> 05:15.774
Reporters are camped out
in front of the palace.

05:16.483 --> 05:17.984
This should be the safest option.

05:18.568 --> 05:19.569
Sir.

05:21.029 --> 05:22.822
The party is asking
about the crisis meeting.

05:22.823 --> 05:24.657
Tell them they'll have to wait.

05:24.658 --> 05:27.743
Make sure no one talks to the press
to avoid speculative coverage.

05:27.744 --> 05:29.161
Yes, sir.

05:29.162 --> 05:31.581
Foreign Affairs is asking
about the overseas tour…

05:32.165 --> 05:34.000
-  Submit it in writing.
- Yes, sir.

05:44.219 --> 05:47.096
Amid growing fallout
from the leaked marriage contract,

05:47.097 --> 05:50.933
the controversy is escalating
beyond a mere private-life scandal,

05:50.934 --> 05:54.228
even drawing scrutiny
over the monarchy's credibility.

05:54.229 --> 05:57.189
The alleged preferential treatment
the Grand Princess received,

05:57.190 --> 05:59.608
and the suspension
of the Junghwajeon fire investigation…

05:59.609 --> 06:02.028
…have emerged
as the central points of this controversy.

06:02.654 --> 06:03.780
Huiju.

06:05.407 --> 06:07.200
Seong Huiju.

06:10.996 --> 06:12.997
-  Seong Huiju.
-  In response, the Crown

06:12.998 --> 06:16.542
has stated it is verifying the facts,
maintaining a cautious stance.

06:16.543 --> 06:19.503
However, critics argue
that the possibility of the exercise

06:19.504 --> 06:21.590
of private influence cannot be ruled out.

06:22.716 --> 06:25.134
Both the Crown and the Cabinet
are reportedly conducting…

06:25.135 --> 06:26.552
Are you okay?

06:26.553 --> 06:29.014
However, neither has yet
released an official statement.

06:33.560 --> 06:34.561
Yes.

06:55.498 --> 06:57.374
Let's start by confirming a few things.

06:57.375 --> 06:58.751
First of all,

06:58.752 --> 07:01.254
did you two draw up
the marriage contract yourselves?

07:09.804 --> 07:13.433
Besides me, does anyone else know
that this marriage is fake?

07:14.017 --> 07:15.644
Aside from my personal aide,

07:16.311 --> 07:17.312
there's no one else.

07:19.439 --> 07:20.774
Just Ms. Do.

07:27.197 --> 07:29.323
I haven't discussed it
with the Royal Secretariat yet,

07:29.324 --> 07:32.494
but they will most likely
choose not to respond.

07:33.828 --> 07:35.120
What do you mean?

07:35.121 --> 07:36.705
As long as the contract is real,

07:36.706 --> 07:38.916
any explanation or defense
will only stir up more noise.

07:38.917 --> 07:41.252
So, are you asking us to stay silent?

07:43.672 --> 07:45.799
Yes. Precisely, Your Royal Highness.

07:50.053 --> 07:52.888
Waiting for things
to die down could backfire on us.

07:52.889 --> 07:55.015
We must wait until even that dies down.

07:55.016 --> 07:56.393
It was only…

08:02.023 --> 08:03.316
a farce in the beginning.

08:13.618 --> 08:15.161
"It only started out as deception."

08:16.246 --> 08:17.330
Is that what you'll say?

08:19.541 --> 08:22.251
The contract stipulates
a divorce within three years.

08:22.252 --> 08:23.336
Can you guarantee

08:24.587 --> 08:25.714
there will be no divorce?

08:34.764 --> 08:36.015
Can you?
:cue

08:49.946 --> 08:50.947
Sir.

08:52.240 --> 08:53.366
You really should see this.

08:58.079 --> 08:59.205
Excuse me for a moment.

09:09.215 --> 09:12.342
I wondered why that brat
would just hand over the company.

09:12.343 --> 09:14.011
Turns out she had a whole plan.

09:14.012 --> 09:16.013
What about that kiss over the palace wall?

09:16.014 --> 09:17.139
Was that fake too?

09:17.140 --> 09:18.474
Of course, it was!

09:18.475 --> 09:21.977
Then what about when she collapsed,
and he carried her out in his arms?

09:21.978 --> 09:23.228
Was that all just an act?

09:23.229 --> 09:25.022
Babe, who cares about that right now?

09:25.023 --> 09:26.900
Our family is about to be ruined!

09:27.901 --> 09:30.152
Well, I'm just worried about Huiju…

09:30.153 --> 09:31.905
What is it now?

09:33.073 --> 09:34.448
What's with all the messages?

09:34.449 --> 09:36.575
ANOTHER SCANDAL WILL BREAK THIS WEEK…

09:36.576 --> 09:39.078
I wondered why Prince I-AN
would marry a love child…

09:39.079 --> 09:41.163
He clearly married
for Castle Group.

09:41.164 --> 09:42.873
So all that talk
about Prince Suyang…

09:42.874 --> 09:44.917
Was her fainting
at the wedding just a stunt?

09:44.918 --> 09:46.086
Babe.

09:46.711 --> 09:48.338
What the hell is going on?

09:50.548 --> 09:52.633
As public trust in the royal couple wavers

09:52.634 --> 09:56.595
following the leak
of their marriage contract earlier today,

09:56.596 --> 10:00.015
incendiary allegations have surfaced
that Grand Princess Seong received

10:00.016 --> 10:03.102
preferential treatment
even prior to the royal wedding.

10:03.103 --> 10:06.480
Grand Princess Seong had previously
been identified as the prime suspect

10:06.481 --> 10:08.732
in the Junghwajeon Hall fire
that broke out

10:08.733 --> 10:10.859
during His Majesty's
Royal Birthday Banquet.

10:10.860 --> 10:14.571
Some critics argue that the Grand Prince
may have intervened in the investigation

10:14.572 --> 10:16.365
for personal reasons.

10:16.366 --> 10:18.909
Some are even voicing concerns

10:18.910 --> 10:22.579
whether he is connected
to the Junghwajeon Hall fire incident.

10:22.580 --> 10:26.333
The political sphere is adopting
a cautious stance,

10:26.334 --> 10:27.627
while the palace and the Cabinet…

10:36.302 --> 10:37.387
Are you scared?

10:40.515 --> 10:42.809
You have to have honor
for disgrace to mean anything.

10:45.061 --> 10:46.855
I've never had any, so I'm fine.

10:55.405 --> 10:56.614
Are you okay?

11:00.285 --> 11:01.911
Honor is all you have.

11:09.460 --> 11:10.461
Are you scared?

11:24.267 --> 11:25.268
Yes.

11:29.522 --> 11:30.690
I am afraid…

11:34.152 --> 11:35.486
that my honor will end up…

11:38.489 --> 11:39.532
harming you.

11:45.997 --> 11:46.998
I believe it's best

11:47.624 --> 11:49.625
for you both to return to the palace now.

11:49.626 --> 11:51.169
What about all the reporters there?

11:51.961 --> 11:53.337
Are you sure it's okay?

11:53.338 --> 11:57.216
They're planning a protest
outside the palace tomorrow morning.

11:57.217 --> 11:58.425
A protest?

11:58.426 --> 11:59.802
What are you talking about?

12:01.721 --> 12:04.140
There's a rumor that
you're vying for the throne.

12:05.183 --> 12:08.060
The Junghwajeon fire is being interpreted
to fit that narrative.

12:08.061 --> 12:09.269
That's absolute nonsense.

12:09.270 --> 12:11.940
Securing your safety comes first.

12:12.482 --> 12:13.524
Return to the palace.

12:20.448 --> 12:24.244
It appears the protest cannot be stopped.

12:25.995 --> 12:27.705
Nothing could possibly stop it now.

12:28.248 --> 12:31.542
To be loved is to be hated
in equal measure.

12:34.170 --> 12:37.298
Nothing stokes gossip like the downfall
of the high and mighty.

12:39.676 --> 12:41.301
Did you deliver the message to Father?

12:41.302 --> 12:43.221
He sent word that he is on his way.

12:51.145 --> 12:52.772
Prepare to enter the Council Hall.
:cue

13:06.202 --> 13:07.369
Your Royal Highness.

13:07.370 --> 13:09.371
You should make your way
to the Council Hall.

13:09.372 --> 13:10.455
Now?

13:10.456 --> 13:13.084
Her Majesty has summoned
the Office of Royal Relatives.

13:40.653 --> 13:42.655
Announcing Grand Prince I-AN.

13:52.665 --> 13:53.958
Your Majesty.

13:56.002 --> 13:58.254
Have you summoned the royal relatives?

14:01.174 --> 14:04.468
- Let's discuss it privately.
- I do not wish to hear your excuses.

14:04.469 --> 14:06.179
- Queen Mother.
- How dare you!

14:07.722 --> 14:09.265
To deceive the people

14:10.308 --> 14:12.060
and bring disgrace upon the Crown.

14:18.524 --> 14:20.443
Do you truly believe you can be forgiven?

14:29.869 --> 14:32.163
You, who sold off your royal status.

14:33.206 --> 14:35.124
And you, who purchased it.

14:36.501 --> 14:38.628
You would do well to prepare yourselves.

14:42.298 --> 14:44.299
I found it rather peculiar from the start,

14:44.300 --> 14:47.135
how she seemed to have no regard
for royal tradition or decorum.

14:47.136 --> 14:48.428
You should stop there.

14:48.429 --> 14:50.139
"It is simply
because of her low pedigree."

14:51.974 --> 14:53.601
That was my oversight.

15:02.819 --> 15:06.738
You thought you could protect yourself
with that measly contract?

15:06.739 --> 15:09.158
I cannot tell if you are naïve or foolish.

15:19.293 --> 15:20.878
Senior Sixth Rank, Choi Hyeon.

15:21.629 --> 15:22.796
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:22.797 --> 15:24.381
Junior Sixth Rank, Do Hyejeong.

15:24.382 --> 15:25.882
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:25.883 --> 15:28.678
Your superiors are unworthy
of an audience in the Council Hall.

15:30.346 --> 15:31.347
Escort them out.

15:42.984 --> 15:43.985
Your Royal Highness.

15:48.614 --> 15:49.615
Your Royal Highness!

15:57.123 --> 15:58.124
Your Royal Highness.

15:59.500 --> 16:00.918
Your Royal Highness.

16:01.502 --> 16:03.712
I'm fine, so just…

16:03.713 --> 16:05.089
You're far from fine!

16:11.179 --> 16:13.055
Who clenches their fist this hard
out of anger?

16:14.849 --> 16:16.434
Just look at this hand.

16:17.602 --> 16:18.728
Stay put.

16:19.228 --> 16:20.855
I'll have Aide Choi get some…

16:27.695 --> 16:28.696
I'm fine.

16:30.823 --> 16:31.824
It doesn't hurt.

17:01.520 --> 17:02.604
This is insane.

17:02.605 --> 17:04.190
It's hit the lower limit.

17:04.815 --> 17:07.776
What if the chairman calls me
to his office? That won't end well.

17:07.777 --> 17:08.778
Hello.

17:10.321 --> 17:11.405
Seriously?

17:12.114 --> 17:13.157
Aide Do!

17:13.741 --> 17:14.742
Yes?

17:15.493 --> 17:16.952
We have a problem.

17:16.953 --> 17:18.286
Why? What is it now?

17:18.287 --> 17:21.582
There's an article claiming
the Grand Princess faked her collapse.

17:22.583 --> 17:23.792
What?

17:23.793 --> 17:25.086
What are you talking about?

17:26.379 --> 17:27.462
THE REASON WHY SHE FAINTED…

17:27.463 --> 17:28.546
WAS THE COLLAPSE STAGED?

17:28.547 --> 17:29.549
Huh?
:cue

17:30.466 --> 17:31.467
It sounds like…

17:32.051 --> 17:33.802
This is about to blow up in our face.

17:33.803 --> 17:36.012
WAS THE COLLAPSE STAGED?
PRESSURE MOUNTS ON ROYAL FAMILY

17:36.013 --> 17:39.516
Remove Grand Prince I-AN
as regent!

17:39.517 --> 17:41.184
Remove him! Remove him!

17:41.185 --> 17:43.812
Grand Prince I-AN
and Seong Huiju must apologize!

17:43.813 --> 17:45.730
Apologize! Apologize!

17:45.731 --> 17:49.401
Remove Grand Prince I-AN
as regent!

17:49.402 --> 17:51.111
Remove him! Remove him!

17:51.112 --> 17:54.489
Strip Seong Huiju
of her rank immediately!

17:54.490 --> 17:55.657
Immediately! Immediately!

18:05.668 --> 18:07.086
We cannot wait any longer.

18:08.588 --> 18:09.589
Your Royal Highness.

18:10.172 --> 18:11.716
They're going so far as to suggest

18:12.967 --> 18:14.802
that my wife fainted for show.

18:17.555 --> 18:19.348
I shall set the record straight myself.

18:22.727 --> 18:25.855
Our marriage may have started
with a contract,

18:27.148 --> 18:30.483
but everything we've shown the people
is genuine.

18:30.484 --> 18:31.651
Your Royal Highness.

18:31.652 --> 18:33.154
Even if the substance found in her system

18:34.697 --> 18:35.823
was one prescribed to me,

18:37.158 --> 18:40.494
there is nothing I seek to gain
at the cost of her life.

18:42.997 --> 18:45.499
What about the claim
that you're vying for the crown?

18:47.710 --> 18:49.337
Will you deny that as well?

18:51.631 --> 18:53.507
- Prime Minister Min.
- Answer me, sir.

18:54.300 --> 18:55.551
Will you deny it?

19:00.931 --> 19:02.224
If I do not deny it,

19:05.436 --> 19:07.146
how would you respond?

19:15.488 --> 19:18.324
"We do not need a king
who lacks the people's support."

19:19.033 --> 19:20.326
That's how I would respond.

19:25.706 --> 19:26.874
Thus, Your Royal Highness…

19:29.585 --> 19:31.504
For the sake of the Crown and the nation,

19:33.756 --> 19:34.757
I humbly request…

19:37.009 --> 19:38.219
that you end your regency.

19:52.233 --> 19:54.317
5 DAYS BEFORE THE CONTRACT LEAK

19:54.318 --> 19:55.319
Sir.

20:04.328 --> 20:07.497
They discovered traces of digoxin
in a goblet used in the wedding rites.

20:07.498 --> 20:09.332
GOBLET CONTAINING
TRACES OF DIGOXIN

20:11.502 --> 20:13.379
Sir, Ms. Lee Areum has arrived.

20:21.095 --> 20:23.556
I heard you asked to see me.

20:28.436 --> 20:30.019
LEE AREUM

20:30.020 --> 20:31.187
IN CHARGE OF THE NUPTIAL WINE

20:31.188 --> 20:33.356
PARK MALJA, HER MOTHER,
BECAME AN ALCOHOLIC…

20:33.357 --> 20:35.526
IN NEED OF FUNDS
FOR BROTHER'S KIDNEY TRANSPLANT

20:42.825 --> 20:44.451
I was instructed to simply grind it up

20:44.452 --> 20:47.662
and rub it on the Grand Prince's goblet.

20:47.663 --> 20:50.290
I had no idea what it was.

20:50.291 --> 20:52.000
I was told if I didn't do it,

20:52.001 --> 20:54.003
my brother's surgery might be delayed…

20:59.049 --> 21:00.217
Do you think it's true?

21:01.302 --> 21:02.470
We'll have to verify it.

21:10.978 --> 21:12.480
But I still don't understand why.

21:16.817 --> 21:18.319
Did they really need to kill him?

21:20.529 --> 21:21.781
I get that he was bothersome…

21:29.747 --> 21:32.291
4 DAYS BEFORE THE CONTRACT LEAK

21:32.917 --> 21:33.918
Prime Minister Min.

21:35.002 --> 21:37.171
What could you possibly
be suggesting right now?

21:43.594 --> 21:45.387
Here's evidence
proving it was a poisoning.

21:49.433 --> 21:52.602
A staff testified that the Grand Prince
was the intended target.

21:52.603 --> 21:55.439
She confirmed the substance used
and her cryptocurrency records.

21:56.357 --> 21:57.525
She also testified

21:58.984 --> 22:01.153
that the compensation
came from Lord INPYEONG.

22:02.863 --> 22:03.906
This is slander.

22:06.575 --> 22:09.327
How dare you suspect my father
on a mere servant's word?
:cue

22:09.328 --> 22:11.663
- You are also under suspicion.
- Prime Minister Min!

22:11.664 --> 22:13.290
Can you prove you had no knowledge

22:14.792 --> 22:16.252
of Lord INPYEONG's actions?

22:25.636 --> 22:26.928
Your Majesty,

22:26.929 --> 22:28.722
Grand Prince I-AN has arrived.

22:42.945 --> 22:44.488
His Royal Highness remains unaware.

22:48.826 --> 22:49.994
Allow me some time.

22:58.919 --> 23:00.004
Your Majesty.

23:00.838 --> 23:02.089
Prime Minister Min.

23:04.508 --> 23:05.509
Until tonight.

23:07.845 --> 23:09.138
That is all I can provide you.

23:14.310 --> 23:15.644
I shall send word.

23:30.034 --> 23:31.910
What brings you here, Prime Minister Min?

23:31.911 --> 23:34.329
I came to request her cooperation
in the investigation.

23:34.330 --> 23:35.873
The Inner Court will be summoned tomorrow.

24:03.359 --> 24:05.319
I'm here to discuss
the Anhwadang Hall staff.

24:14.286 --> 24:15.287
Your Majesty?

24:21.126 --> 24:24.004
I heard you were looking
to replace the attendants.

24:25.631 --> 24:28.425
Are you feeling unwell?

24:30.636 --> 24:32.554
The Grand Princess collapsed
at the wedding.

24:33.597 --> 24:36.141
Now, the Grand Prince seeks
to replace innocent attendants.

24:37.434 --> 24:39.061
The palace is in disarray, is it not?

24:54.952 --> 24:55.953
Jeongwoo!

24:58.455 --> 25:00.373
Should you be outside already?

25:00.374 --> 25:01.624
Did the doctor…

25:01.625 --> 25:03.960
I don't need to hear that
from you too.

25:03.961 --> 25:06.129
My ears are about to bleed as it is.

25:06.130 --> 25:09.882
It appears she is weary from all the care
the Grand Prince has taken

25:09.883 --> 25:11.551
to protect the Grand Princess.

25:11.552 --> 25:14.971
Given how devoted they are to each other,
producing an heir should not be…

25:14.972 --> 25:16.806
What…

25:16.807 --> 25:19.308
…in the world are you talking about?

25:19.309 --> 25:21.561
In broad daylight, no less.

25:25.024 --> 25:26.608
Are you free for a short walk?

25:28.694 --> 25:29.778
Hmm.

25:30.654 --> 25:32.156
How's the investigation going?

25:32.781 --> 25:33.949
Are you getting anywhere?

25:35.242 --> 25:38.704
Can we trust Royal Seoul Hospital?

25:39.496 --> 25:41.123
If you want, I can have Castle Hospital…

25:44.084 --> 25:45.085
What?

25:47.379 --> 25:48.505
It seems real.

25:49.131 --> 25:50.132
What does?

25:51.008 --> 25:52.091
Your devotion?

25:52.092 --> 25:54.927
Devotion? As if.

25:54.928 --> 25:58.057
Can't I even show
this much concern for my spouse?

26:02.853 --> 26:04.229
My goodness.

26:08.233 --> 26:10.611
You know our marriage is only for show.

26:11.987 --> 26:13.988
How are we supposed to fool the nation

26:13.989 --> 26:15.657
if we can't even fool the staff?

26:17.701 --> 26:18.702
So?

26:19.870 --> 26:21.163
You're trying to fool me too?

26:21.789 --> 26:22.831
What?

26:25.793 --> 26:26.835
Sir.

26:32.508 --> 26:34.968
His Majesty is due to give
his witness statement shortly.

26:38.764 --> 26:39.807
I should go.

26:41.850 --> 26:43.268
But I'm not done talking yet…

26:44.311 --> 26:45.979
I'll call you later…
:cue

26:57.699 --> 26:59.701
Evidence that proves
it was a poisoning.

27:00.494 --> 27:03.663
A staff testified that the Grand Prince
was the intended target.

27:03.664 --> 27:06.625
She confirmed the drug used
and her cryptocurrency records.

27:09.211 --> 27:11.463
She testified the compensation
came from Lord INPYEONG.

27:20.472 --> 27:21.473
Your Majesty.

27:22.099 --> 27:23.684
What brings you here unannounced?

27:25.394 --> 27:26.520
Explain yourself.

27:27.312 --> 27:28.564
- Your Majesty.
- I said!

27:31.567 --> 27:32.818
Explain yourself.

27:52.045 --> 27:53.338
Tell me it was not you.

27:53.881 --> 27:55.172
LEE AREUM

27:55.173 --> 27:56.884
WITNESS STATEMENT

27:59.636 --> 28:01.179
Where did you get this?

28:06.768 --> 28:09.271
I asked where you got this.

28:11.189 --> 28:13.566
Were you truly attempting to murder
the Grand Prince?

28:17.154 --> 28:18.488
Have you lost your mind?

28:19.156 --> 28:22.366
If this gets out,
you, me, and His Majesty will be--

28:22.367 --> 28:23.368
That is…

28:26.079 --> 28:29.249
exactly why the Grand Prince
must be eliminated.

28:34.004 --> 28:37.757
Why do you think the Grand Prince,
who feigned ignorance,

28:37.758 --> 28:40.135
has chosen to speak up now?

28:40.844 --> 28:43.804
Not only did you burn
the late King's final royal edict.

28:43.805 --> 28:45.307
But imagine

28:46.058 --> 28:48.893
what would happen if he discovers
the same fire killed the late King.

28:48.894 --> 28:50.895
I had nothing to do
with the late King's death!

28:50.896 --> 28:52.481
Who would ever believe

28:53.023 --> 28:55.359
such a feeble excuse?

28:57.986 --> 28:59.820
Father…

28:59.821 --> 29:01.864
"I only intended to burn the royal edict.

29:01.865 --> 29:03.450
I never intended for that fire

29:04.159 --> 29:06.995
to burn down the palace hall
and take the King's life."

29:08.664 --> 29:10.123
Is that what you will say?

29:17.631 --> 29:19.883
Is that what you have thought of me
all this time?

29:30.352 --> 29:34.564
What Your Majesty has done
is not my concern.

29:35.899 --> 29:38.484
You must do whatever it takes
to keep His Majesty safe.

29:38.485 --> 29:40.736
That is the only way

29:40.737 --> 29:42.989
to ensure your own safety,

29:42.990 --> 29:45.158
mine, and our family name.

30:01.008 --> 30:02.467
Now, tell me.

30:04.636 --> 30:05.804
Where did you

30:07.389 --> 30:09.433
get this from?

30:35.709 --> 30:37.044
Your Majesty.

30:41.798 --> 30:42.799
Grand Princess.

30:49.306 --> 30:51.016
You would do well to tread carefully.

31:08.867 --> 31:09.950
Sir.

31:09.951 --> 31:11.578
The Queen Mother is calling. It's urgent.

31:12.079 --> 31:14.956
I'll connect you now.

31:18.418 --> 31:20.045
HUIJU

31:27.677 --> 31:29.971
:cue

31:36.019 --> 31:41.942
3 DAYS BEFORE THE CONTRACT LEAK

32:22.065 --> 32:23.400
How does it feel

32:23.900 --> 32:27.154
to have the man hailed
as the greatest prime minister in history

32:28.113 --> 32:29.446
as a father?

32:29.447 --> 32:30.657
PRIME MINISTER MIN SEUNGJAE

32:33.368 --> 32:34.369
I'm not sure.

32:35.537 --> 32:38.664
How does it feel
to have a father who will be known

32:38.665 --> 32:39.875
as the most dangerous lord

32:41.001 --> 32:42.377
in history?

32:44.754 --> 32:46.715
That will not be his legacy.

32:48.592 --> 32:49.676
Are you denying it?

32:51.511 --> 32:53.221
I wish to make a request.

32:54.681 --> 32:58.101
I thought about what would lead you
to bring me that evidence.

33:00.187 --> 33:02.439
If I were a suspect in your eyes…

33:05.358 --> 33:07.861
why did you come to me
and not the Grand Prince?

33:11.239 --> 33:13.116
Do you wish to have the Grand Princess?

33:38.683 --> 33:40.226
MARRIAGE CONTRACT

33:40.227 --> 33:41.602
Should that come to light,

33:41.603 --> 33:43.813
the court will be in turmoil
and the nation in chaos.

33:46.149 --> 33:48.817
All the benefits outlined in the contract
favor the Grand Princess.

33:48.818 --> 33:51.613
Thus, the tide of condemnation
will break upon her.

33:54.991 --> 33:57.327
Do you think I would just let that happen?

33:57.953 --> 34:00.038
It is clear you are intent
on taking her for yourself.

34:02.040 --> 34:04.167
And you do not want her to suffer, either?

34:07.420 --> 34:08.755
Then,

34:10.173 --> 34:13.343
I shall redirect that tide to Prince I-AN.

34:15.053 --> 34:18.056
The more the Grand Prince
is driven to the brink,

34:19.057 --> 34:21.935
the more her resolve
is bound to crumble, is it not?

34:26.606 --> 34:27.732
What is the matter?

34:28.441 --> 34:30.902
Did you presume I could not perceive

34:31.820 --> 34:34.030
what you so plainly see between them?

34:37.033 --> 34:39.076
The Grand Prince smiles
when he drives too.

34:39.077 --> 34:41.287
He can be so childlike sometimes.

34:41.288 --> 34:43.206
He's in danger right now!

34:44.040 --> 34:45.292
I like Seong Huiju.

34:47.544 --> 34:49.462
You have tonight to consider your options.

34:50.839 --> 34:52.382
That is all I can provide you.

35:21.661 --> 35:23.455
:cue

36:38.822 --> 36:40.907
Do you possess the authority to request…

36:43.868 --> 36:45.161
that I end the regency?

36:47.414 --> 36:49.207
I have a duty to protect the Crown.

36:53.169 --> 36:54.337
You make it sound…

36:56.798 --> 36:58.925
as though I sought to harm it.

36:59.926 --> 37:01.678
The Crown represents the nation.

37:03.263 --> 37:05.639
As long as you represent the Crown,

37:05.640 --> 37:06.933
you and the Crown

37:07.684 --> 37:08.977
are one.

37:10.395 --> 37:11.730
So?

37:13.481 --> 37:14.607
Face your downfall alone.

37:17.444 --> 37:18.695
I will not allow you

37:20.655 --> 37:22.365
to drag the Crown down with you.

37:44.387 --> 37:46.263
A private meeting with Prime Minister Min?

37:46.264 --> 37:49.183
Yes, Your Majesty.
They started early this morning.

37:49.184 --> 37:51.144
It has already been three hours.

37:51.686 --> 37:53.605
The Cabinet must be feeling
the pressure as well.

37:57.609 --> 37:58.610
What about Seong Huiju?

37:59.527 --> 38:00.736
Pardon?

38:00.737 --> 38:03.615
Is the Grand Princess alone right now?

38:04.365 --> 38:05.408
What?

38:06.701 --> 38:09.369
He told him to end his regency?
Jeongwoo did?

38:09.370 --> 38:10.454
Yes.

38:10.455 --> 38:13.582
I mean, I really trusted
Prime Minister Min.

38:13.583 --> 38:15.000
I know we're in a tight spot and all,

38:15.001 --> 38:17.544
but it's not like he doesn't know
what's going on.

38:17.545 --> 38:19.130
They crossed a line here, didn't they?

38:21.758 --> 38:23.759
The Queen Mother is asking for you.

38:23.760 --> 38:25.178
Well, I'm about to lose it.

38:44.614 --> 38:46.074
How does it feel?

38:49.202 --> 38:51.663
How does it feel to have dragged down

38:53.122 --> 38:55.583
the cherished prince of the nation?

39:00.755 --> 39:02.631
He had his moments of eccentricity

39:02.632 --> 39:04.801
and would sometimes go astray,

39:06.553 --> 39:09.180
but until he met you, I-AN was…

39:11.516 --> 39:13.268
the pride of the Crown.

39:18.231 --> 39:20.483
What did you offer him?

39:23.319 --> 39:25.154
What did he gain

39:26.364 --> 39:28.324
by elevating you so?

39:37.333 --> 39:38.793
Did you not read the contract?

39:40.962 --> 39:43.798
His Royal Highness
does not want anything from me.

39:46.050 --> 39:48.761
He even settled for three years,
as long as I was with him.

39:51.389 --> 39:52.932
So I simply agreed to do so.

40:21.836 --> 40:24.546
How does it feel
to have dragged down

40:24.547 --> 40:27.008
the cherished prince of the nation?

40:34.974 --> 40:35.975
Your Royal Highness.

40:37.185 --> 40:38.936
You should head to the King's Quarters.

40:38.937 --> 40:40.604
Has His Majesty summoned me?

40:40.605 --> 40:42.606
I believe Lord INPYEONG is there

40:42.607 --> 40:44.399
with a formal appeal to the king

40:44.400 --> 40:45.526
and even a public petition.

40:51.574 --> 40:52.908
Emergency.

40:52.909 --> 40:54.369
Come to the King's Quarters
when you see this.

40:59.874 --> 41:02.042
THE NOBLE COUNCIL LEADER
AND 190 MEMBERS…

41:02.043 --> 41:03.418
THE LOVE STORY
THAT FOOLED THE NATION…

41:03.419 --> 41:04.420
Your Majesty.

41:05.088 --> 41:07.172
The Crown will crumble at this rate.

41:07.173 --> 41:09.299
Even the Grand Prince

41:09.300 --> 41:11.678
cannot defy your royal command.

41:12.720 --> 41:14.346
But Uncle…

41:14.347 --> 41:15.640
Your Majesty!
:cue

41:17.475 --> 41:19.936
Have you not heard the rumors
spreading among the people?

41:20.728 --> 41:23.606
- The fire that took the late king…
- That is not true!

41:24.357 --> 41:26.024
Father was not…

41:26.025 --> 41:27.859
The Grand Prince knows that you are weak,
that is why--

41:27.860 --> 41:29.361
Your Majesty.

41:29.362 --> 41:30.947
The Grand Prince…

41:41.666 --> 41:44.668
How dare you show
such insolence before His Majesty!

41:44.669 --> 41:46.045
How dare you!

41:49.674 --> 41:51.467
How dare you threaten His Majesty?

41:54.804 --> 41:56.097
Why you…

41:56.973 --> 41:58.641
Uncle…

41:59.559 --> 42:00.810
Enter, Court Lady Jung.

42:03.021 --> 42:04.897
Your Royal Highness!

42:05.773 --> 42:06.858
Escort His Majesty out.

42:08.776 --> 42:10.527
Do you not hear me?

42:10.528 --> 42:11.654
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

42:14.032 --> 42:15.241
Grand Prince…

42:18.703 --> 42:19.996
Your Majesty.

42:35.303 --> 42:37.472
Do you think I'm oblivious
to your scheming?

42:40.475 --> 42:42.769
Your… Royal…

42:44.312 --> 42:45.313
Your Royal Highness!

42:47.732 --> 42:48.733
Your Royal Highness.

42:49.317 --> 42:51.152
Please let him go first…

42:51.652 --> 42:53.821
Are you afraid I will become king?

42:59.285 --> 43:01.329
If you wish to drive me from the palace,

43:03.039 --> 43:04.248
you will

43:04.916 --> 43:06.417
have to kill me first.

43:08.086 --> 43:09.420
Your Royal Highness!

43:16.094 --> 43:18.054
If you threaten my nephew again…

43:20.765 --> 43:22.517
you shall not be granted a merciful death.

43:48.793 --> 43:50.169
Uncle…

43:58.886 --> 44:00.847
THAT DAY, 3 YEARS AGO

44:03.850 --> 44:05.851
The Queen is inside.

44:05.852 --> 44:07.895
Please wait here for a moment.

44:09.021 --> 44:10.022
Understood.

44:13.067 --> 44:15.278
Uncle!

44:35.464 --> 44:37.800
You intend for Grand Prince I-AN
to ascend the throne?

44:39.719 --> 44:42.471
Have you truly gone mad?

44:48.519 --> 44:50.479
It will be better than dying.

44:52.398 --> 44:54.192
It would be better to die.

45:05.036 --> 45:06.495
I would rather see you dead.

45:08.664 --> 45:10.374
For the sake of the Crown Prince.

45:12.418 --> 45:13.711
My Queen!

45:25.723 --> 45:26.806
Your Majesty.

45:26.807 --> 45:27.808
Yes…

45:47.536 --> 45:48.537
Your Majesty.

45:49.330 --> 45:50.331
Yes?
:cue

45:54.627 --> 45:55.670
If you are ever scared…

46:01.884 --> 46:03.094
…you must come to me.

46:06.764 --> 46:07.807
Whenever that may be.

46:29.203 --> 46:30.413
Come to me…

46:33.666 --> 46:34.667
whenever you get scared.

46:38.587 --> 46:41.007
Yes, Uncle.

47:13.956 --> 47:14.957
What's wrong?

47:15.541 --> 47:16.584
What?

47:17.626 --> 47:19.253
Did you wrong me somehow?

47:23.507 --> 47:24.550
Earlier…

47:28.471 --> 47:29.472
Sorry.

47:31.474 --> 47:32.475
For what?

47:33.601 --> 47:34.894
That unpleasant sight.

47:37.521 --> 47:38.564
I thought it was pleasant.

47:40.024 --> 47:41.441
What?

47:41.442 --> 47:42.443
You did well.

47:44.362 --> 47:45.863
You must fight back

47:47.198 --> 47:48.199
if you wish…

47:50.451 --> 47:52.119
to protect something.

48:15.226 --> 48:16.727
Any likes or dislikes?

48:17.978 --> 48:18.979
All of a sudden?

48:20.481 --> 48:23.484
Well, I like…

48:24.819 --> 48:28.406
Flowers. I do like them the most.

48:31.534 --> 48:32.743
What?

48:33.869 --> 48:35.955
- Not you.
- Pardon?

48:36.539 --> 48:38.165
What does the Grand Prince like?

48:39.041 --> 48:40.375
Oh. I see.

48:40.376 --> 48:41.918
The Grand Prince.

48:41.919 --> 48:43.711
-  So silly.
- Unbelievable.

48:43.712 --> 48:45.923
Why do you ask?

48:46.465 --> 48:49.551
More stress is
the only thing waiting for him.

48:49.552 --> 48:51.845
I thought I could do
something nice for him.

48:51.846 --> 48:53.722
Maybe a favorite snack or music?

48:55.558 --> 48:56.851
Let me think.

48:57.476 --> 48:59.728
Black tea? He likes black tea.

49:00.688 --> 49:02.982
He also likes bitter chocolate.

49:05.025 --> 49:06.109
What about music?

49:06.110 --> 49:08.445
Nope. He doesn't like anything loud.

49:08.446 --> 49:09.613
Mmm.

49:10.573 --> 49:12.949
What about his favorite scent?

49:12.950 --> 49:14.284
Scent?

49:14.285 --> 49:15.952
Like incense sticks or diffusers.

49:15.953 --> 49:19.080
That will get you kicked out instantly.

49:19.081 --> 49:23.294
He flipped out the last time
I put on some cologne.

49:25.087 --> 49:26.714
Noted. I should stop.

49:30.301 --> 49:32.470
Did you show
the Grand Princess the same care?

49:33.471 --> 49:34.472
Yes.

49:34.972 --> 49:37.141
One works best without distractions.

49:43.272 --> 49:44.565
What about you, Hyejeong?

49:47.318 --> 49:48.319
Pardon?

49:49.820 --> 49:53.656
I mean, it looks like you just know
the names of flowers.

49:53.657 --> 49:55.743
You don't seem that crazy about tea.

49:58.037 --> 50:00.789
What do you like, Hyejeong?

50:04.835 --> 50:05.961
Well…

50:12.510 --> 50:13.511
I…

50:18.390 --> 50:19.433
I was

50:20.559 --> 50:21.894
just curious. That's all.

50:24.605 --> 50:25.689
Such nice weather.
:cue

51:13.612 --> 51:14.655
I'm scared

51:16.240 --> 51:17.533
that my honor will end up…

51:21.453 --> 51:22.454
harming you.

51:26.792 --> 51:27.793
Me too.

51:31.547 --> 51:33.424
I'm scared I might end up…

51:36.427 --> 51:37.636
ruining you.

52:10.085 --> 52:13.546
Seong Huiju!
I know public opinion's in the gutter,

52:13.547 --> 52:15.466
but a prosecutor's investigation?
Seriously?

52:16.008 --> 52:17.717
I'm dying over here with tanking stocks.

52:17.718 --> 52:20.763
What the hell are you talking about?

52:27.978 --> 52:30.648
All the board members
have been subpoenaed.

52:33.359 --> 52:35.486
Father is about to be summoned
at this rate.

52:38.072 --> 52:40.366
Okay, I'll be there this afternoon.

52:42.660 --> 52:43.910
What's wrong?

52:43.911 --> 52:45.495
Is something happening at the company?

52:45.496 --> 52:48.498
No. I guess Father is a bit unwell.

52:48.499 --> 52:49.541
The chairman?

52:50.125 --> 52:51.919
- Then we should visit him--
- No need for all that.

52:52.503 --> 52:55.588
That will only end up attracting a crowd.

52:55.589 --> 52:57.298
It'll be better if I make
a quick run with Aide Choi.

52:57.299 --> 52:59.592
- It's nothing serious anyway.
- But still…

52:59.593 --> 53:01.387
You two need to attend court.

53:01.970 --> 53:03.137
Go on.

53:03.138 --> 53:05.974
Let's have another productive day today.

53:06.809 --> 53:07.810
I'll call you.

53:08.394 --> 53:09.520
Good luck!

53:17.736 --> 53:18.904
Get a car ready.

53:19.571 --> 53:21.364
You want to go now?

53:21.365 --> 53:22.783
Not an escort vehicle.

53:23.909 --> 53:25.327
One that I can drive.

53:25.994 --> 53:26.995
Understood.

54:06.785 --> 54:08.036
What do I have to do?

54:10.664 --> 54:12.207
You must know.

54:13.250 --> 54:16.043
Both the company and the palace
are a complete train wreck.

54:16.044 --> 54:18.045
And there's nothing I can do.

54:18.046 --> 54:19.381
At this rate…

54:25.596 --> 54:26.847
So tell me.

54:29.099 --> 54:30.434
Tell me what I should do.

54:38.567 --> 54:39.568
For now,

54:41.028 --> 54:42.112
do nothing.

54:42.696 --> 54:45.865
- What?
- I'll make sure you don't get hurt, so--

54:45.866 --> 54:47.326
I'm not asking you to protect me.

54:53.415 --> 54:55.375
You're not even pretending now?

54:58.378 --> 54:59.462
What?

54:59.463 --> 55:00.797
You said it was all for show.

55:01.798 --> 55:02.799
You and the Grand Prince.

55:12.643 --> 55:13.894
I don't think that's true now.
:cue

55:17.439 --> 55:18.732
What's that supposed to mean?

55:25.030 --> 55:26.114
I like him.

55:27.449 --> 55:28.450
The Grand Prince.

55:33.080 --> 55:34.122
A lot.

55:47.135 --> 55:48.136
That is…

55:52.474 --> 55:53.475
quite unfortunate.

56:17.374 --> 56:19.042
To the chairman now?

56:26.842 --> 56:27.843
Let's go now.

56:28.844 --> 56:29.970
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

56:32.723 --> 56:34.057
I messed up.

56:39.605 --> 56:41.480
What are you doing?

56:41.481 --> 56:42.524
Huiju.

56:43.817 --> 56:45.485
I deceived you…

56:48.238 --> 56:49.865
and hurt the company.

56:53.076 --> 56:54.494
I'm sorry for all of it.

56:59.916 --> 57:00.917
Please help me.

57:15.891 --> 57:17.684
Just this once, please help me, Father.

57:20.854 --> 57:22.147
I want to make things right…

57:24.775 --> 57:26.234
but I don't know how.

57:33.283 --> 57:35.243
And you call yourself a businesswoman…

57:44.211 --> 57:45.212
Tell me.

57:46.254 --> 57:48.090
Who are you trying to save here? Yourself?

57:48.590 --> 57:49.800
Or the Grand Prince?

58:12.739 --> 58:15.367
Um, I heard you enjoyed black tea.

58:18.787 --> 58:19.788
Thank you.

58:26.461 --> 58:29.172
Perhaps you might consider
taking a few days off?

58:31.508 --> 58:33.927
What's going on?

58:35.387 --> 58:40.016
The Prime Minister's Office has requested
that you cease your official duties.

58:43.979 --> 58:44.980
A request?

58:49.067 --> 58:50.777
Maybe just for a few days…

58:51.778 --> 58:53.405
NEW MESSAGE

58:53.989 --> 58:55.240
I'll be there soon.

58:58.994 --> 59:01.705
Do not say anything to my wife.

59:02.414 --> 59:04.458
Yes, Your Royal Highness.
:cue

01:00:00.722 --> 01:00:01.723
Your Royal Highness.

01:00:08.313 --> 01:00:09.689
How's your father doing?

01:00:17.823 --> 01:00:19.533
What's this? A gift?

01:00:25.080 --> 01:00:26.081
Your Royal Highness.

01:00:28.208 --> 01:00:29.209
Yes?

01:00:40.762 --> 01:00:41.972
Let's get a divorce.

01:01:18.174 --> 01:01:19.550
EPILOGUE

01:01:19.551 --> 01:01:20.552
Tell me.

01:01:21.094 --> 01:01:22.928
Who are you trying to save here? Yourself?

01:01:22.929 --> 01:01:24.347
Or the Grand Prince?

01:01:31.730 --> 01:01:32.814
Him.

01:01:37.527 --> 01:01:39.571
I can save myself.

01:01:43.116 --> 01:01:44.117
You…

01:01:47.662 --> 01:01:49.247
Please, Father.

01:01:59.090 --> 01:02:02.010
PERFECT CROWN

01:02:38.630 --> 01:02:40.131
I want to cut my losses.

01:02:40.715 --> 01:02:42.008
Let's get a divorce.

01:02:43.259 --> 01:02:44.594
Is this how it felt?

01:02:46.137 --> 01:02:48.305
Are they really
going to get divorced?

01:02:48.306 --> 01:02:51.183
You must stop either
the Grand Prince or His Majesty.

01:02:51.184 --> 01:02:52.685
Do whatever you must.

01:02:52.686 --> 01:02:53.895
But you lost it all.

01:02:54.479 --> 01:02:56.189
What could you possibly do for me now?

01:02:56.773 --> 01:02:57.856
Did you truly believe

01:02:57.857 --> 01:03:00.734
I could not protect us?

01:03:00.735 --> 01:03:02.486
Surely you do not intend to accept.

01:03:02.487 --> 01:03:05.864
I need the girl I hid
brought to the palace.

01:03:05.865 --> 01:03:07.409
You did not trust me.

01:03:09.494 --> 01:03:11.287
The palace gates
will be shut soon.

01:03:12.622 --> 01:03:13.665
Let's see this through.

01:03:14.749 --> 01:03:15.834
I will be by your side.

01:03:17.585 --> 01:03:19.587
Translated by Justin S. Kim

01:03:30.890 --> 01:03:34.602
PERFECT CROWN
